sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React 前端
    participant API as Express 路由
    participant TM as TaskModel
    participant SCH as Scheduler
    participant EB as EventBus (SSE)
    participant DB as SQLite

    Note over UI,DB: 创建任务
    UI->>API: POST /api/tasks {name, sourceRepo, targetRepo, branches, syncFrequency, ...}
    API->>TM: createTask(req)
    TM->>DB: INSERT INTO tasks (branches JSON, sync_frequency 分钟数, ...)
    DB-->>TM: 返回新任务
    TM-->>API: Task 对象
    API-->>UI: {code:0, data: Task}

    Note over UI,DB: 启动定时同步
    UI->>API: POST /api/sync/:id/start
    API->>TM: updateTaskStatus(id, 'idle')
    TM->>DB: UPDATE tasks SET status='idle'
    TM->>EB: broadcast('taskStatusChange', {status:'idle'})
    API->>SCH: registerTask(taskId, syncFrequency分钟)
    Note over SCH: minutesToCron(N) → "0 */N * * * *"
    SCH-->>API: 注册成功
    API-->>UI: {code:0, data: {taskId, status:'idle'}}

    Note over UI,DB: 手动触发同步（等待结果）
    UI->>API: POST /api/sync/:id/trigger
    API->>API: executeSync(taskId, 'manual')
    Note over API: 同步等待完成（非异步）
    API-->>UI: {code:0, data: SyncLog, message:'同步成功/失败'}

    Note over UI,DB: 编辑任务（频率变更自动重注册）
    UI->>API: PUT /api/tasks/:id {syncFrequency: 新频率}
    API->>TM: updateTask(id, req)
    TM->>DB: UPDATE tasks SET sync_frequency=新频率
    API->>SCH: registerTask(taskId, 新频率) [若任务已注册则重注册]
    API-->>UI: {code:0, data: Task}

    Note over UI,DB: 删除任务（清理本地缓存）
    UI->>API: DELETE /api/tasks/:id
    API->>SCH: unregisterTask(taskId)
    API->>TM: deleteTask(id)
    TM->>DB: DELETE FROM tasks WHERE id=?
    Note over TM: 自动删除 data/repos/{taskId}/ 目录
    API-->>UI: {code:0, data: {}}
